  message: "Merged in c727ae1c9 (PR #3304). emit_module_attribute_refs gained a scoped_path=True mode (left-recursive walk over path/name fields, dot-normalized module paths in the edge ID). IoBoundaryCatalog._rebuild_indices registers dot-form aliases for ::-containing qualified names so scoped-path edges hit the qualified lookup index. Wired into the tree-sitter Rust analyzer with std injected as an implicit import. WI-lozug PR 4 regression-guard stub flipped to positive emission (TestRustModuleAttrRefsScoped, 4 tests). C++ qualified_identifier wire-up deferred — filed as WI-zojid (needs cpp.yaml with std::cout/cerr/cin attributes first, can then use the same helper with node_kinds=('qualified_identifier',)). Groovy/Kotlin scoped_identifier remains out of scope until their respective YAML catalogs gain attributes entries."  # d532
